### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "laxdev",
  "email": "laxdev@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "laxdev@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123"
}

### Try registering with invalid email (should fail validation)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ab",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "123"
}
### Login and get JWT
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "laxdev@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123"
}